# Synology Drive and macOS filesystem artifacts.
#
# These belong to the NAS and the Finder, not to the application. They appear
# and disappear as the drive syncs, and _Conflict copies in particular show up
# whenever Synology restores a folder that was moved while it was running.
# Committing any of them puts one machine's filesystem state into everyone's
# checkout.
.DS_Store
._*
Icon?
.SynologyWorkingDirectory
@eaDir/
\#recycle/
.@__thumb/
*_Conflict
*_Conflict.*
*_Conflict/
